  "sn17.34:1.1": "sāvatthiyaṃ viharati … tatra kho bhagavā … ",
  "sn17.34:1.2": "dāruṇo bhikkhave lābhasakkārasiloko …pe… ",
  "sn17.34:1.3": "lābhasakkārasilokena abhibhūtassa pariyādinnacittassa bhikkhave devadattassa sukko dhammo samuccheda magamā. ",
  "sn17.34:1.4": "evaṃ dāruṇo kho bhikkhave lābhasakkārasiloko …pe… ",
  "sn17.34:1.5": "sikkhitabbanti. ",
  "sn17.34:1.6": "catutthaṃ. "
}
